## Why This Is Asked
This tests building a real-time monocular CV system for dynamic hardware libraries, with weekly revisions and constrained edge compute.

## Key Concepts
- 6-DoF pose from monocular cues with PnP and depth priors
- On-device adaptation with 5-shot via lightweight meta-learning adapters
- Synthetic+real data and domain randomization
- Real-time constraints on edge GPU

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: simple reprojection error
function reprojectionError(X3D, x2D, K, R, t) {
  const X = math.add(math.multiply(R, X3D), t);
  const x = project(K, X);
  return norm(subtract(x2D, x));
}
```

